       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.1. Current Situation Analysis Report (including mapping of local stakeholders, touristic values inventory) 1.2. Destination based Energy Efficiency Report 1.3. A Gender Action Plan 1.4. A Situation Analysis on womens employment opportunities in the energy sector 1.5. An analysis on innovative financial models for sustaining the energy efficient transformations

2.2. Destination based strategy and roadmap on a) sustainable consumption and production b) strategy and roadmap on environmentally friendly transportation systems c) green procurement and supply chain management
